WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.400
Below the report there is a box for questions.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.600
They are answered from the pages already read.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.600
Here is one about cost at forty orders a month.

4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.600
It works through each plan and gives the figure.

5
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.700
Every number in the answer carries its reference.

6
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.800
Here is one the pages do not cover.

7
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.600
It says so, rather than answering.

8
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.000
And offers to go and look, which uses another report.

9
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.700
Watching for changes is next.
